# References only: NAME=op://vault/item/field. No value is ever written here, and no agent or CI job resolves one.
# Used by the repository's owner, on a workstation, for the one process that needs them:
#   op run --env-file packages/infra/env/op.env -- bunx alchemy deploy packages/infra/src/GitHub.stack.ts --stage prod
#
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY, production's model key (decision I5), is added here by the owner as a reference to the
# 1Password item that holds it. Without it a production deploy stops and says so; DEPLOY_WITHOUT_MODEL_KEY=true
# deploys without a model on purpose, and production's rules then answer.
